    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Brandon Muchendu Njoroge's path to family medicine was not a straightforward one. Initially unsure of his direction, he considered various specialties, including pathology, internal medicine, radiology, and psychiatry. However, his decision to pursue family medicine at AKU was solidified after an insightful open day hosted by the University.",
